{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is <i>Iris Odyssey</i>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/45707bc708fe68e4d3f63aa89bae6a9a.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/45707bc708fe68e4d3f63aa89bae6a9a.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iris Odyssey</i> is a classic text-based adventure game set in modern-day Shibuya. The story follows Fuka, a &quot;girl searching for her brother,&quot; and Iris, a &quot;crime investigator with magical powers,&quot; as they embark on an adventure filled with heartfelt encounters. The game features choices that players can make, which will unlock new story elements as the narrative progresses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Allure of Iris Odyssey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/83f86f295647860324cef3523ab8a9f8.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/83f86f295647860324cef3523ab8a9f8.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iris and Fuka come from completely different worlds\u2014yet as they journey together through a realm of magic, their bond deepens in unexpected and heartfelt ways. Experience the evolution of a dynamic and intimate relationship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/753c062dccadbee5c391f82ee5df0615.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/753c062dccadbee5c391f82ee5df0615.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuka, an orphaned girl living in Shibuya, is searching for her only family member, her missing brother Mitsuba. Along her journey, she awakens to her hidden magical powers. Meanwhile, Iris, a seasoned magic investigator, is pursuing a criminal organization of rogue sorcerers known as the <i>Skyseekers</i>. Her investigation leads her to take an interest in this brother and sister duo, who appear to be connected to the group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Fuka and Iris grow closer, they come to share a bond like family. Will this bond be enough to shatter the conspiracy that awaits them? Join Fuka and Iris in a modern fantasy adventure filled with destiny, intrigue, and magic in the opening chapter of <i>Iris Odyssey</i>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/0612c98dfc6971ea59b00172e3dc4ba3.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/0612c98dfc6971ea59b00172e3dc4ba3.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;There are some moral question in this world that are more important than your own survival. I'll prove it even if it'll cost me my life.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magic investigator with a strong sense of justice and responsibility.<br>She meets Fuka during a mission, and with time, their bond grows stronger than even a family one.<br>As a proficient magic user, she acts as a mentor for Fuka.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/34df9ee2669501c8f18cdbabb45210c9.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/34df9ee2669501c8f18cdbabb45210c9.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I don't want anyone to pity me just because I'm an orphan.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A middle-schooler freshman who is looking for her disappeared brother. The two of them were brought up together in the &quot;Mule House&quot; orphanage, but eventually, she ends up living with Iris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/afea43ba99f1eeaac3f688e4cdfc001a.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/afea43ba99f1eeaac3f688e4cdfc001a.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;How can I be so stupid? I could just fight.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A university student who is friends with Iris. She's always considerate of others and really loves her liquor. Despite appearances, she is good at dealing with all kinds of trouble, a skill which she uses to help Iris with her work. She seems bothered by Fuka's sudden appearance in her friend's life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/f41a2f89bcc378bc5ca0fd5ef2f659fa.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/f41a2f89bcc378bc5ca0fd5ef2f659fa.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I'm planning my life in my own way, for myself. That's all.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuka's older brother who disappeared three years ago. The police has given up on finding him, and his sister is the only one who's still trying. He's a crucial element in the nefarious plots that Iris is investigating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263400?t=1773638055","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263400?t=1773638055","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/4e2a392db4ed85f6456fd32cc19afc9dbcee8821/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773638055","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/4e2a392db4ed85f6456fd32cc19afc9dbcee8821/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773638055","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3751270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is <i>Iris Odyssey</i>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/45707bc708fe68e4d3f63aa89bae6a9a.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/45707bc708fe68e4d3f63aa89bae6a9a.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iris Odyssey</i> is a classic text-based adventure game set in modern-day Shibuya. The story follows Fuka, a &quot;girl searching for her brother,&quot; and Iris, a &quot;crime investigator with magical powers,&quot; as they embark on an adventure filled with heartfelt encounters. The game features choices that players can make, which will unlock new story elements as the narrative progresses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Allure of Iris Odyssey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/83f86f295647860324cef3523ab8a9f8.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/83f86f295647860324cef3523ab8a9f8.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iris and Fuka come from completely different worlds\u2014yet as they journey together through a realm of magic, their bond deepens in unexpected and heartfelt ways. Experience the evolution of a dynamic and intimate relationship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/753c062dccadbee5c391f82ee5df0615.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/753c062dccadbee5c391f82ee5df0615.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuka, an orphaned girl living in Shibuya, is searching for her only family member, her missing brother Mitsuba. Along her journey, she awakens to her hidden magical powers. Meanwhile, Iris, a seasoned magic investigator, is pursuing a criminal organization of rogue sorcerers known as the <i>Skyseekers</i>. Her investigation leads her to take an interest in this brother and sister duo, who appear to be connected to the group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Fuka and Iris grow closer, they come to share a bond like family. Will this bond be enough to shatter the conspiracy that awaits them? Join Fuka and Iris in a modern fantasy adventure filled with destiny, intrigue, and magic in the opening chapter of <i>Iris Odyssey</i>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/0612c98dfc6971ea59b00172e3dc4ba3.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=