ally loves her liquor. Despite appearances, she is good at dealing with all kinds of trouble, a skill which she uses to help Iris with her work. She seems bothered by Fuka's sudden appearance in her friend's life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras/f41a2f89bcc378bc5ca0fd5ef2f659fa.avif?t=1773638055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/extras_big/f41a2f89bcc378bc5ca0fd5ef2f659fa.avif?t=1773638055 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I'm planning my life in my own way, for myself. That's all.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuka's older brother who disappeared three years ago. The police has given up on finding him, and his sister is the only one who's still trying. He's a crucial element in the nefarious plots that Iris is investigating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Eisnid"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263400/header.jpg?t=1773638055","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3263400/1596038718/824a3ec9b9ec16bae75a766a28fed4de612615ac/1758640696/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759744763","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3263400/1596038718/824a3ec9b9ec16bae75a766a28fed4de612615ac/1758640696/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759744763","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.ste